### Comando válido (esperado: 202)
POST http://localhost:8080/command
Content-Type: application/json

{ "command": "LEFT" }

### Comando inválido (esperado: 400, sem retry)
POST http://localhost:8080/command
Content-Type: application/json

{ "command": "JUMP" }

### Contagem de comandos gravada pelo mining-service
GET http://localhost:8082/commands
